From: NavQ95 <navq95@local>
Subject: [PATCH] imx95: move BL33 (U-Boot) out of the M7 DDR window

MR-NAVQ95 reserves 0x90000000-0x914FFFFF for M7 firmware. Loading U-Boot
at 0x90200000 overwrites the running M7 image on every A55 LM reboot.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific configuration]

---
 plat/imx/imx9/imx95/include/platform_def.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plat/imx/imx9/imx95/include/platform_def.h b/plat/imx/imx9/imx95/include/platform_def.h
--- a/plat/imx/imx9/imx95/include/platform_def.h
+++ b/plat/imx/imx9/imx95/include/platform_def.h
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 
 /* non-secure uboot base */
 /* TODO */
-#define PLAT_NS_IMAGE_OFFSET		U(0x90200000)
+#define PLAT_NS_IMAGE_OFFSET		U(0x91600000)
 #define BL32_FDT_OVERLAY_ADDR           (PLAT_NS_IMAGE_OFFSET + 0x3000000)
 
 /* GICv4 base address */
